  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat Team, I love to world hop but ever since the new UI it has become less fun to do so. Whenever you scroll past the inital first worlds on lets say the \"new\" tab and you join a world the world tab bounces back to the top after joining said world which makes you scroll down again to the world you just joined. And only then I can keep on world hopping having to scroll past all the world I already visited. It does not remember where you left of in the world tab menu. For the first worlds its no problem but the moment you need to scroll it becomes such a nuisance to always scroll back to the last map you visited that i just dont world hop anymore. I would love if the world tabs just stay on the world you last visited so I dont always have to scroll back down again. Thank you.",
